---
import { SECTIONS } from '../config';
---

<section id={SECTIONS.why} aria-labelledby="why-heading" class="section container-page">
  <div class="split">
    <h2 id="why-heading" class="split__head">The people who love you are terrible at this.</h2>

    <div class="split__body">
      {/* Everyone else's opinion, one per line and muted: none
           of them get a speech mark, because none of them bring sources. */}
      <p class="why__others">
        <span>Your friends say it’s genius.</span>
        <span>Your parents say be careful.</span>
        <span>LinkedIn says quit your job.</span>
        <span class="why__verdict">Nobody shows their sources.</span>
      </p>

      <p class="why__body">
        For every Zomato, there’s a graveyard of food apps nobody remembers. That’s survivorship bias: you only hear
        from the ones who made it, because the ones who didn’t aren’t posting about it. We give tours of the graveyard,
        so you don’t have to move in.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .why__others {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }

  .why__verdict {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-product);
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    font-weight: 540;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .why__body {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
</style>
